{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Welcome to Datquinso Desktop Pets!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">These pets are cute, expressive, and most importantly, low-profile.<br>They\u2019re designed to keep you company without getting in your way \u2014 whether you're working, gaming, or just chilling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you don\u2019t interact with them, they\u2019ll simply hang out on your screen until someone (or something!) wakes them up.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udc3e Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83c\udfa8 Customize</strong><br>Choose from a variety of fur styles, faces, and clothing options to make each pet unique and stylish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83c\udfae Play</strong><br>Pets will bounce around, chase toys, stack on top of each other, and even grab your mouse (if you let them). You can also give them head pats :3</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\ude34 Sleep</strong><br>When you\u2019re away, your pets will cling to nearby windows or the taskbar and take naps. Give them a little shake or a gentle pat to wake them up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83e\udd1d Share</strong><br>Send your favorite pets to friends using the built-in friends menu. Just exchange friend codes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udcec Visit</strong><br>Pets marked as friends will occasionally visit your desktop, joining your main pet for a surprise appearance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83c\udf3f Care</strong><br>Your pets gently remind you to drink water, take breaks, and offer a few kind words to keep your spirits up during long sessions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udd12 Privacy</strong><br>This app does not access the internet or collect any data from your system. It\u2019s fully offline by design \u2014 even friend codes work without a connection. No guessing, no tracking, just pets.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3897940?t=1753734391","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3897940?t=1753734391","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897940/21847ff22767ee72bbb634d686243ab1d63bc60c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753734391","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897940/21847ff22767ee72bbb634d686243ab1d63bc60c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753734391","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3898100,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Welcome to Datquinso Desktop Pets!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">These pets are cute, expressive, and most importantly, low-profile.<br>They\u2019re designed to keep you company without getting in your way \u2014 whether you're working, gaming, or just chilling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you don\u2019t interact with them, they\u2019ll simply hang out on your screen until someone (or something!) wakes them up.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udc3e Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83c\udfa8 Customize</strong><br>Choose from a variety of fur styles, faces, and clothing options to make each pet unique and stylish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83c\udfae Play</strong><br>Pets will bounce around, chase toys, stack on top of each other, and even grab your mouse (if you let them). You can also give them head pats :3</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\ude34 Sleep</strong><br>When you\u2019re away, your pets will cling to nearby windows or the taskbar and take naps. Give them a little shake or a gentle pat to wake them up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83e\udd1d Share</strong><br>Send your favorite pets to friends using the built-in friends menu. Just exchange friend codes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udcec Visit</strong><br>Pets marked as friends will occasionally visit your desktop, joining your main pet for a surprise appearance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83c\udf3f Care</strong><br>Your pets gently remind you to drink water, take breaks, and offer a few kind words to keep your spirits up during long sessions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udd12 Privacy</strong><br>This app does not access the internet or collect any data from your system. It\u2019s fully offline by design \u2014 even friend codes work without a connection. No guessing, no tracking, just pets.</p>","developers":["Datquinso"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897940/2fccf8dacc3e054f466a7ed1b6492b3366d35679/header.jpg?t=1753734391","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257172454,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257172454/movie480.mp4?t=1753734387","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257172454/movie_max.mp4?t=1753734387"},"name":"Desktop Pets Fun","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257172454/21ae287f2bd7a08ea035f7534ae8ba6dce2f2cef/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1753734387","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257172454/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1753734387","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257172454/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1753734387"}},{"highlight":false,"id":257172459,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257172459/movie480.mp4?t=1753734390","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store